{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players frantically craft candy to feed a dragon while fending away gremlins, then use canon candies to fight monsters in this chaotic co-op kitchen defense game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644500/extras/bd76227644854020ee886ba6faaa56a1.avif?t=1754215538\" /></div> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The dragon needs candy to strengthen itself for the epic battle ahead. Follow recipes to craft the perfect candies within the time limit, but watch out - if it's not what the dragon requested, it'll get spat out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644500/extras/aca48f49e1ce271cc8cde910c9dabd4f.avif?t=1754215538\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Work under pressure in this chaotic candy-making experience! Team up to make the process faster and more efficient:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Melt sugar and mix in different colored dyes,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Freeze and cool the sugar to create your candy base,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Shape and mould the sugar into various forms,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Package your creations and deliver them to the Dragon</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644500/extras/9f76f49217540bd084f4ed64b052918f.poster.avif?t=1754215538\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644500/extras/9f76f49217540bd084f4ed64b052918f.webm?t=1754215538\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644500/extras/9f76f49217540bd084f4ed64b052918f.mp4?t=1754215538\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644500/extras/5fa4df247d55df679f0ddcf47c9cb642.avif?t=1754215538\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hungry gremlins will try to swipe ingredients from your kitchen, bowls, and machines - or even attack you directly! Strategically place ingredients on traps to keep their attention away from your candy-making chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644500/extras/5c148c004f05fc99a43bb526900ce2fc.poster.avif?t=1754215538\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644500/extras/5c148c004f05fc99a43bb526900ce2fc.webm?t=1754215538\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644500/extras/5c148c004f05fc99a43bb526900ce2fc.mp4?t=1754215538\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644500/extras/536dd4b5fe26a24c599c246e80ead473.avif?t=1754215538\" /></div>When the dragon distracts the enemy, it's your turn to fight back! Create melted sugar cannonballs to launch at monsters, but keep an eye on the dragon's calorie counter - zero calories means you have to start all over!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644500/extras/81e55370d45cf3db844732309257ee2b.avif?t=1754215538\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> The monster fights back by throwing meteors to disrupt your candy crafting. Stay alert and keep your production line moving!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644500/extras/a7c27df9c3cf82ef24f4e32e0a6de871.poster.avif?t=1754215538\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644500/extras/a7c27df9c3cf82ef24f4e32e0a6de871.webm?t=1754215538\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644500/extras/a7c27df9c3cf82ef24f4e32e0a6de871.mp4?t=1754215538\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644500/extras/fcdb9bf81162e27f4cd9fd9f47d17ba2.avif?t=1754215538\" /></div>This demo gives you a peek at what's coming a slice of the whole game to experience </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Complete candy crafting system and combat mechanics,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Co-operative multiplayer gameplay 1-4 Players,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">One exciting level to experience,</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644500/extras/c54362d328bc5d66cae5412b83b82df3.avif?t=1754215538\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiple recipes,